Package: nvidia-legacy-580xx-open-driver
Architecture: amd64
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 nvidia-legacy-580xx-open-driver-libs (= ${binary:Version}),
 nvidia-legacy-580xx-open-driver-bin (= ${binary:Version}),
 xserver-xorg-video-nvidia-legacy-580xx-open (= ${binary:Version}),
 nvidia-legacy-580xx-open-kernel-support (= ${binary:Version}),
Provides: nvidia-legacy-driver
Conflicts: nvidia-driver, nvidia-legacy-driver
Replaces: nvidia-legacy-driver
Description: NVIDIA legacy 580.178.04 driver metapackage (Turing+ recommended; also Maxwell/Pascal/Volta (same GPUs as 580xx))
 The 580.178.04 driver from the NVIDIA 580xx-open legacy series, repackaged as a
 reproducible build for noble.
 .
 Supported hardware: Turing+ recommended; also Maxwell/Pascal/Volta (same GPUs as 580xx).
 .
 UPSTREAM STATUS: Open-source flavour of the 580 branch: builds the kernel-open/ modules (MIT/GPL-2 dual-licensed) instead of the proprietary blob modules. Same userspace libraries. NVIDIA's preferred path going forward.

