 The nvidia_drv.so X.Org video driver from the 580.178.04 release.
 Officially targets X server video driver ABI <= 25.


Package: nvidia-legacy-580xx-open-driver-libs
Architecture: amd64
Multi-Arch: same
Section: non-free/libs
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends},
 libgl1, libglx0, libegl1, libgbm1,
Provides:
 nvidia-legacy-580xx-open-driver-libs-nonglvnd,
 libgl1-nvidia-glx,
 libgl1-nvidia-legacy-580xx-open-glx,
 vdpau-driver,
 libglx-nvidia,
Description: NVIDIA legacy 580.178.04 driver — runtime libraries
 Every shared library from the NVIDIA 580.178.04 userspace: libGL / libGLX_nvidia
 / libEGL_nvidia, libnvidia-glcore, libnvidia-tls, libnvidia-eglcore,
 libnvidia-ml, libcuda and friends, plus the GLX X extension module. Install the
 :i386 variant alongside for 32-bit applications.

Package: nvidia-legacy-580xx-open-kernel-support
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: NVIDIA legacy 580.178.04 driver — kernel/X integration glue
 Ships the nouveau blacklist, the modprobe alias, the initramfs hook, the udev
 rules and the /etc/X11/xorg.conf.d snippet for the 580.178.04 driver.

Package: nvidia-legacy-580xx-open-kernel-6.14.0-1-generic
Architecture: amd64
Section: non-free/kernel
