Description: NVIDIA legacy 580xx-open prebuilt module for Linux 6.14.0-1-generic
 The nvidia/-modeset/-drm/-uvm modules from the 580xx-open series,
 compiled for the 6.14.0-1-generic kernel ABI. No toolchain needed on the target.
